 on the corner, on the side of it, on Orleans and . . . can't think of that street. I worked there. I was a delivery boy. Saw some hell of a sights back then. Worked there 'til I started playing full time, and then I got the job with Willie Pajeaud, on El Alamo, at Burgundy and Canal [streets]. Upstairs over the Woolw ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13937$192EDF82-1C19-4E5D-B976-AAA06450E982", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "82d39aeda02cab5a6db0deb81d5877ad63d8b03a", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/eb031d08a1a7e4523782556da91b06a1/371.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13937$D9BE76A6-E90C-47C6-B9A3-6F1749937F3D", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "95c53e1122801180b126ad63faf0dadffce6ba86", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1619, "id": "Q1619"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13937$9306B52A-0472-4318-BDDC-CE67F4FF93D7", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "1716bcd35dbd3cdf7e1e2be8ef5fe8839edc6759", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1192, "id": "Q1192"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13937$550D4FD0-A6FD-4F93-B4C8-CD6A3871654F", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "3f8af7186971a1daece6521d8053dc947dafbc7b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1192, "id": "Q1192"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13937$F902CDD4-77CA-40EB-8C94-FD895320F58B", "rank": "normal"}]}}